                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I dedicated several hours to playing this game with friends while enjoying some beers, and I had an immensely enjoyable experience. This is the exhilarating couch multiplayer PC game that we have been seeking.\n\nFor enthusiasts of local multiplayer games, Square x Square presents a commendable option for purchase. In addition to being relatively affordable, the game offers a diverse array of combinations for customizing your build. The graphics are straightforward, lacking intricate details, yet they remain quite appealing. The game features only two modes: a free-for-all and a timed mode. Regarding the maps, I estimate there are approximately ten distinct options available. The random events are particularly entertaining and unpredictable, as they can significantly alter the course of the battle, both positively and negatively, which I believe is the game's most notable feature.",
